# Line endings are deterministic for this project.
#
# The repository is hosted on Windows (core.autocrlf=true is set globally),
# but every text file in the project is authored and stored with LF endings.
# `eol=lf` overrides the global autocrlf behaviour so that:
#   - text is stored as LF in the repository, and
#   - text is checked out as LF on any machine, including this one.
# This removes the "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and means a clone
# from any host produces byte-identical text files.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never touched or line-ending converted.

*.apk    binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.mp3    binary
*.m4a    binary
*.ogg    binary
*.wav    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.zip    binary
*.jar    binary
*.jks    binary
*.keystore binary
